{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "#INNER UNIVERSE 1F0000",
    "steam_appid": 2164050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/bbdc3abc7d5c4ad1155b4c629376f349.poster.avif?t=1741008820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/bbdc3abc7d5c4ad1155b4c629376f349.webm?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/bbdc3abc7d5c4ad1155b4c629376f349.mp4?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>360\u00b02D Shooter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an STG where you fly 360\u00b0 around the stage and engage in dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It requires a good feeling of flying a fighter plane and shooting accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Always Bullet Time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have the superpower to stop time every frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your bullets will always hit and your enemies' bullets will always be avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It should be the easiest shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it is like getting into a car and resisting the urge to step on the gas pedal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/4ca2c16b2c00a2ceafb19d7d709cbfc0.poster.avif?t=1741008820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/4ca2c16b2c00a2ceafb19d7d709cbfc0.webm?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/4ca2c16b2c00a2ceafb19d7d709cbfc0.mp4?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Machine Customization</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can tune your fighter between stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it the turning performance, the boost gauge, the ammunition load, or the reload time for each weapon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both the operating technique and machine maintenance in racing games are important, and maintenance is not simply a factor that makes you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same is true in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DemoVersion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Episode1 is distributed free of charge until Ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is to fully convey the special experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like it, please subscribe to our WishList.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are planning to produce up to Episode3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(English translation of Episode3 may be delayed)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/bbdc3abc7d5c4ad1155b4c629376f349.poster.avif?t=1741008820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/bbdc3abc7d5c4ad1155b4c629376f349.webm?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/bbdc3abc7d5c4ad1155b4c629376f349.mp4?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>360\u00b02D Shooter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an STG where you fly 360\u00b0 around the stage and engage in dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It requires a good feeling of flying a fighter plane and shooting accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Always Bullet Time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have the superpower to stop time every frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your bullets will always hit and your enemies' bullets will always be avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It should be the easiest shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it is like getting into a car and resisting the urge to step on the gas pedal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/4ca2c16b2c00a2ceafb19d7d709cbfc0.poster.avif?t=1741008820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/4ca2c16b2c00a2ceafb19d7d709cbfc0.webm?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164050/extras/4ca2c16b2c00a2ceafb19d7d709cbfc0.mp4?t=1741008820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Machine Customization</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can tune your fighter between stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it the turning performance, the boost gauge, the ammunition load, or the reload time for each weapon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both the operating technique and machine maintenance in racing games are important, and maintenance is not simply a factor that makes you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same is true in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DemoVersion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Episode1 is distributed free of charge until Ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is to fully convey the special experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like it, please subscribe to our WishList.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are planning to produce up to Episode3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(English translation of Episode3 may be delayed)</p>",
    "short_description": "This 360\u00b0 STG offers the tension of a dogfight and a turn-based strategy. As a hero with the superpower of time-stopping, you fight, talk, and maintain your aircraft in the inner universe, aiming to save everything in the world.",
